From cf8a5866408ac079e21b4fdad525b4bc0dfeb650 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:40:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: rc: List the HK1 RBOX X4 native keymap

Full validation of the compiled HK1 DTB rejects rc-hk1-rbox-x4,
which the consolidated candidate already implements and selects.
Add its exact name to the shared keymap enum, in alphabetical order.

Treat diagnostic output as failure even when dt-validate returns zero.
No IR protocol, scancode, hardware wiring or existing keymap changes.

Change-Id: Icf32f708d15edc234bb852e0e9c33878df54ac39
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
index dedc5a4b81ecb08d3554ea9aace0cc54b9e9aa71..4ad873d84ef530e20036d2a569a2d823dce82d7c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
@@ -78,6 +78,7 @@ properties:
       - rc-hauppauge
       - rc-hisi-poplar
       - rc-hisi-tv-demo
+      - rc-hk1-rbox-x4
       - rc-imon-mce
       - rc-imon-pad
       - rc-imon-rsc
